OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,CToday:FA frosty start, with some fog   
OL,6,Fpatches at first, clearing to a cold   
OL,7,Fand bright day for most. Light patches 
OL,8,Fof rain possible in southern areas.    
OL,9,FIncreasing winds and further rain will 
OL,10,Farrive in the far southwest later.     
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers to begin in the       
OL,13,Fsouth, with a band of heavy rain and   
OL,14,Fgusty winds approaching affecting the  
OL,15,Fregion through the early hours.        
OL,16,FFeeling cold in the strong winds.      
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
