OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,CTuesday:FShowers to begin in the       
OL,6,Fsouth, with a band of heavy rain and   
OL,7,Fgusty winds approaching affecting the  
OL,8,Fregion through much of the day.        
OL,9,FFeeling chilly in the strong winds.    
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FPatchy
OL,12,Frain to begin, quickly clearing to     
OL,13,Fleave sunny spells through much of     
OL,14,FWednesday and into Thursday. Rain      
OL,15,Freturns slowly through Friday with     
OL,16,Fincreasing winds, particularly at      
OL,17,Fwestern coasts.                        
